  "description": "Revenge 13 years in the making. \n\nTo reverse a curse put on her and her brother, Yeju has been searching for the shaman responsible for 13 long years. When the heir to the Tiger Clan, Heewu, sets Yeju up in order to steal her sword, the two realize that they have the same objective. But is this new man friend or foe? \n\n(Source: Manta)",
